# The main GIF: look around, select, copy with the plan, the card, Ctrl+Z takes it back.
Set Framerate 15
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/demo.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo main ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Show
Sleep 1s
Type@450ms "jjj"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Backspace
Sleep 900ms
Down 2
Sleep 400ms
Space
Down
Space
Down
Space
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+L
Type@90ms "~/Documenti"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+V
Sleep 2500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+Z
Sleep 2500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
